  {
    "source": "What do you have to say about the selection of Stuart Symington as your running mate?",
    "zh": "对于选择斯图尔特·赛明顿作为你的竞选搭档，你有什么话要说的？",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/questions_json/451@1/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "During the Great Depression, the federal government began a policy of farm subsidies to stabilize farm incomes and to target a specific output of each crop. Are these policies still necessary in 1960?",
    "zh": "在大萧条期间，联邦政府开始实施农业补贴政策，以稳定农场收入并确定每种作物的特定产量。这些政策在 1960 年还有必要吗？",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/questions_json/481@15/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/questions_json/481@18/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/questions_json/481@18/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/questions_json/481@16/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "What would you do as President to combat increasing unemployment in America's industrial cities?",
    "zh": "作为总统，您会采取什么措施来应对美国工业城市不断增加的失业率？",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/questions_json/491@20/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/questions_json/491@16/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/questions_json/491@21/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/questions_json/491@16/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/questions_json/491@21/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Stuart Symington is a close friend of mine and a tireless advocate for liberalism in the United States. I look forward to working with him for the next four years.",
    "zh": "斯图尔特·赛明顿是我的一位密友，也是美国自由主义的不懈倡导者。我期待着在接下来的四年里与他合作。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3666@4/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Stuart Symington has served his home state of Missouri well for many years, as Harry Truman himself has noted, and is a staunch Democrat.",
    "zh": "斯图尔特·赛明顿多年来一直很好地服务于他的家乡密苏里州，正如哈里·杜鲁门本人所指出的，并且是一名坚定的民主党人。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3667@5/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We have too much of a farm surplus right now, and we need to reduce subsidies for production so that prices can fall into balance and benefit the consumer.",
    "zh": "我们现在的农业剩余太多了，我们需要减少对生产的补贴，这样价格才能趋于平衡，让消费者受益。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3754@36/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3754@38/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3754@44/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3754@43/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "I think these programs need to be phased out over time, but in such a way that we don't bring sudden instability to our nation's farm policy.",
    "zh": "我认为这些计划需要随着时间的推移逐步取消，但这样我们就不会给我们国家的农业政策带来突然的不稳定。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3755@37/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3755@39/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3755@45/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3755@44/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "They are absolutely necessary. Farmers are not in a good position to bargain for their crops, and any economic weakness in that sector can easily cause a recession in the broader economy.",
    "zh": "它们是绝对必要的。农民没有处于有利地位来讨价还价他们的农作物，该部门的任何经济疲软都很容易导致更广泛的经济衰退。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3756@38/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3756@40/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3756@46/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Rockefeller/answers_json/3756@45/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need more spending and should consider lower taxes to stimulate American economy and industry.",
    "zh": "我们需要更多支出，并应考虑降低税收来刺激美国经济和工业。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3786@68/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3786@67/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3786@66/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3786@67/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3786@62/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need to strengthen our labor unions and protections for the nation's industry, including trade protections if necessary.",
    "zh": "我们需要加强工会和对国家工业的保护，包括必要时的贸易保护。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3787@69/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3787@68/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3787@67/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3787@68/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3787@63/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "If we continue our current economic policies, the economy should continue to recover into the 1960s and we will see a rebound in our employment rate.",
    "zh": "如果我们继续实行目前的经济政策，经济应该会继续复苏到 20 世纪 60 年代，我们的就业率将会出现反弹。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3788@70/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3788@69/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3788@68/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3788@69/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3788@64/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "We need lower taxes, fewer regulations, and a smaller federal government. This will encourage private enterprise and spur a recovery to our industrial capacity.",
    "zh": "我们需要更低的税收、更少的监管和更小的联邦政府。这将鼓励私营企业并刺激我们的工业产能恢复。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answers_json/3789@71/description",
      "1960_Kennedy_Humphrey/answers_json/3789@70/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Lodge/answers_json/3789@69/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Dirksen/answers_json/3789@70/description",
      "1960_Nixon_Goldwater/answers_json/3789@65/description"
    ]
  },
  {
    "source": "Symington is perfectly capable, but politically he doesn't bring any particular region outside of Missouri to the fold.",
    "zh": "赛明顿完全有能力，但在政治上他不会将密苏里州之外的任何特定区域纳入其中。",
    "keys": [
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answer_feedback_json/1210@6/answer_feedback",
      "1960_Kennedy_Symington/answer_feedback_json/1211@7/answer_feedback"
    ]
  },
  {
